# 2-device minimum (spec §2.2; todo_list §"如时间紧" 允许).
# Only Linux laptop + headless server; NO Windows, NO cloud. The
# analysis_template.md `## 降级 2 设备 影响段` section is REQUIRED
# in this config's downstream analysis so reviewers know two coverage
# axes are missing entirely.

kind: topology
topology_enum: 2-device-min
devices:
  - device_kind: laptop
    role: driver
    listen: 127.0.0.1:18092
    fallback_label: "降级 2 设备-min (laptop only; 无 slave-B, 无 slave-C)"
  - device_kind: headless
    role: observer,slave-a
    listen: 127.0.0.1:18091
    fallback_label: "降级 2 设备-min (headless only; observer + slave-A)"
workloads:
  - cross-device-code-mod
per_workload_reps: 3
notes: |
  Dropped coverage (both must be flagged in analysis_template.md
  `## 降级 2 设备 影响段` section):
    - 无 cross-OS coverage: windows-only-artifact workload is
      unavailable in this config (removed from workloads list).
    - 无 cross-internet tunnel coverage: cloud sandbox absent, so
      agentserver real-tunnel cost is unmeasured.
